{%- comment -%}
  TireDrop: local vs non-local block for the Shopify "Order confirmation" email.
  Paste into Settings → Notifications → Customer notifications → Order confirmation →
  Edit code, on a new line directly after the element that contains {{ email_body }}.

  STORE = the customer picked "Ship to store for install" (cart attribute
  "Delivery", set on the product page or the cart). If checkout still has a
  delivery address, they get a "want it switched?" note instead.
  LOCAL = local pickup, or a shipping ZIP in Miami-Dade / Broward / Palm Beach
  (prefixes 330–334), excluding the Florida Keys (Monroe County ZIPs).
  To change the area, edit the two lists below. The Flow workflow
  "Order routing: local vs ship" uses the same lists.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign td_local_prefixes = "330,331,332,333,334" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign td_excluded_zips = "33001,33036,33037,33040,33041,33042,33043,33045,33050,33051,33052,33070" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign td_zip = shipping_address.zip | default: "" | strip -%}
{%- assign td_zip5 = td_zip | slice: 0, 5 -%}
{%- assign td_zip3 = td_zip | slice: 0, 3 -%}
{%- assign td_choice = attributes.Delivery | default: "" -%}
{%- assign td_mode = "ship" -%}
{%- if td_choice contains "Ship to store" -%}
  {%- if delivery_method == "pick-up" -%}
    {%- assign td_mode = "store" -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign td_mode = "store_mismatch" -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- elsif delivery_method == "pick-up" -%}
  {%- assign td_mode = "pickup" -%}
{%- elsif td_local_prefixes contains td_zip3 -%}
  {%- unless td_excluded_zips contains td_zip5 -%}
    {%- assign td_mode = "local" -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}
<div style="margin: 20px 0; padding: 16px 18px; border: 1px solid #0068E8; border-radius: 8px; background: #F2F7FF; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #111;">
{%- if td_mode == "store" %}
  <strong style="font-size: 16px;">Shipping free to Extreme Tires for your install</strong><br>
  We'll email you as soon as your tires arrive at the shop. Then pick a bay time: reply to this email or call <a href="tel:+19547731896" style="color: #0068E8;">(954) 773-1896</a> and mention {{ order_name }}.<br>
  Installation is booked and paid separately at the shop.<br>
  <span style="color: #444;">Extreme Tires · 7712 West Oakland Park Blvd, Sunrise, FL 33351</span>
{%- elsif td_mode == "store_mismatch" %}
  <strong style="font-size: 16px;">Quick check on your delivery</strong><br>
  You chose to ship to our store for installation, but checkout has a delivery address, so right now these ship to that address.<br>
  Want them sent to Extreme Tires in Sunrise for install instead? Reply to this email or call <a href="tel:+19547731896" style="color: #0068E8;">(954) 773-1896</a> before they ship and we'll switch it.
{%- elsif td_mode == "pickup" %}
  <strong style="font-size: 16px;">Pickup at Extreme Tires, Sunrise FL</strong><br>
  We'll email you when your tires are ready. Bring your order number ({{ order_name }}) and a photo ID.<br>
  <strong>Want them installed while you're here?</strong> Reply to this email or call <a href="tel:+19547731896" style="color: #0068E8;">(954) 773-1896</a> to book a bay time.<br>
  <span style="color: #444;">7712 West Oakland Park Blvd, Sunrise, FL 33351</span>
{%- elsif td_mode == "local" %}
  <strong style="font-size: 16px;">You're in our South Florida install area</strong><br>
  Your tires ship free to your address. Prefer them installed? We can mount them at our Sunrise shop or come to you with mobile service.<br>
  Reply to this email or call <a href="tel:+19547731896" style="color: #0068E8;">(954) 773-1896</a> and mention {{ order_name }}.<br>
  <span style="color: #444;">Extreme Tires · 7712 West Oakland Park Blvd, Sunrise, FL 33351</span>
{%- else %}
  <strong style="font-size: 16px;">Free shipping to your door</strong><br>
  We'll send tracking as soon as your tires ship. When they arrive, any local tire shop can mount and balance them. Bring your order confirmation.<br>
  Questions about fitment or delivery? Reply to this email or write to <a href="mailto:info@tiredroponline.com" style="color: #0068E8;">info@tiredroponline.com</a>.
{%- endif %}
</div>
